{"unit_id":"Oscar-Williams__dsh-deepatlas#card-zh","repo":"Oscar-Williams/dsh-deepatlas","commit":"6e8677b50ebdd0a9c9812ce44fd185f4dd60cb39","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepAtlas 是一款 DSH 插件导航工具，提供生态扫描、插件索引、任务检索和能力建议。它通过在 DSH 注册六个工具接入会话：用户确认后可扫描并在本地建立索引，查看索引状态，再按自然语言需求和能力标签查找候选插件。建议功能会参考当前 profile 中已安装插件，只在识别到能力缺口且找到匹配项时给出建议。用户还可查看目标插件信息并预览固定版本的安装流程；默认配置为试运行。适合需要在 DSH 中发现、比较和管理社区插件的用户。扫描会访问 GitHub，token 可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:20","src/tools/scan.ts:13","src/tools/find.ts:13","src/tools/advise.ts:50","src/tools/install.ts:22"]}
{"unit_id":"Oscar-Williams__dsh-deepatlas#card-en","repo":"Oscar-Williams/dsh-deepatlas","commit":"6e8677b50ebdd0a9c9812ce44fd185f4dd60cb39","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepAtlas helps DSH users discover community plugins. Its six tools build and check a local index, search by task and capabilities, suggest plugins for unmet needs, and preview a pinned installation plan. Scanning contacts GitHub; a token is optional, and dry run is enabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:20","src/tools/scan.ts:13","src/tools/find.ts:13","src/tools/advise.ts:50","src/tools/install.ts:22"]}
