{"unit_id":"Oscar-Williams__dsh-deepatlas#feature-1","repo":"Oscar-Williams/dsh-deepatlas","commit":"6e8677b50ebdd0a9c9812ce44fd185f4dd60cb39","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepAtlas 的功能「生态扫描」：扫描 DSH 插件来源并建立或增量刷新本地索引；需要调用者明确确认，完成后返回条目数、数据源状态和索引位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools/scan.ts:13"]}
